  "description": "Lee Chan-Ha, a high school ethics teacher, enjoyed a carefree lifestyle, never holding back women who came to him, nor trying to keep those who left. One night, while out at a club as usual, a mysterious man named Ryu Jun-Hyeok appeared before him. Having no interest in men, he tries to ignore Jun-Hyeok, but is drawn in by his provocation, feeling an intense curiosity that leads them to spend the night together. He intended to brush it off as a brief fling, but the very next day, they run into each other at school?! On top of that, Jun-Hyeok begins to approach Chan-Ha with increasing boldness…\n\n *“Who the hell are you calling a slut? You slutty bastard.”*\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
